---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { website } from '../seo/jsonld';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Privacy · Scintille"
	description="What Scintille collects: no cookies, no accounts, only anonymous visit counts from Cloudflare Web Analytics."
	jsonLd={[website()]}
>
	<main>
		<p><a href="/">← Scintille</a></p>
		<h1>Privacy</h1>
		<p>
			Scintille has no accounts, no forms, no advertising and sets no cookies. The only thing it stores in your
			browser is your display choice for the cloud layer, which never leaves your device.
		</p>

		<h2>Audience measurement</h2>
		<p>
			Visits are counted with <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/">Cloudflare Web Analytics</a>.
			It uses no cookies, local storage or fingerprinting and does not track you across sites. It records anonymous,
			aggregate figures only: pages viewed, referrer, country, browser and device type, and page load times. Because
			nothing is stored on your device, no consent banner is needed.
		</p>

		<h2>Hosting</h2>
		<p>
			The site and its data files (<code>data.scintille.app</code>) are served by Cloudflare. Like any web server,
			Cloudflare processes your IP address and request details to deliver pages and protect the site from abuse,
			under its own <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">privacy policy</a>.
		</p>

		<h2>Storms near you</h2>
		<p>
			To suggest storms near you, the site asks Cloudflare for the approximate city of your connection. It is rounded
			to about 10 km, used for that answer only and never stored. A place you pick is sent the same way.
		</p>

		<h2>Third parties</h2>
		<p>
			Fonts and textures are served from Scintille's own domains; the analytics script comes from Cloudflare. No
			content is loaded from social networks, advertisers or other trackers.
		</p>

		<h2>Publisher and contact</h2>
		<p>
			Scintille is published by [TO COMPLETE: publisher name], [TO COMPLETE: postal address]. For any question
			about this page or your data, write to [TO COMPLETE: contact email].
		</p>

		<p class="updated">Last updated: [TO COMPLETE: date].</p>
	</main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	main {
		max-width: 42rem;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 3rem 1rem 4rem;
		font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}
	a {
		color: #9fc3ff;
	}
	h2 {
		margin-top: 2rem;
		font-size: 1.15rem;
	}
	.updated {
		margin-top: 2.5rem;
		opacity: 0.7;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}
</style>
